{"name":"Google Maps No Website Lead Finder API","description":"<article style=\"width:100%;min-width:0;max-width:100%;contain:inline-size;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:anywhere;box-sizing:border-box;color:#475467;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;\"><p style=\"max-width:100%;margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;\">Automatically find Google Maps businesses without a listed independent website. Capture business details, public contact paths, website evidence, and lead priority for web design outreach.</p><h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;max-width:100%;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">What Does Google Maps No Website Lead Finder Do?</h2><p style=\"max-width:100%;margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;\">The Bot searches public Google Maps using the selected industry, country, and location, opens each visible business profile, and checks whether a business has a listed independent website. It returns every checked business as one flat structured row so web design agencies, local marketing teams, and lead generation specialists can review evidence, contact paths, and lead status without rebuilding the workflow.</p><h3 style=\"max-width:100%;margin:28px 0 12px;color:#182230;font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Key Features</h3><ul style=\"max-width:100%;margin:0 0 20px;padding-left:24px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;overflow-wrap:anywhere;box-sizing:border-box;\"><li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Find businesses where an independent website was not verified.</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Keep every checked business with an evidence-backed lead status.</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Capture public phone, email, contact page, website, and social routes when available.</li></ul><h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;max-width:100%;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">What Data Can I Extract?</h2><div style=\"width:100%;min-width:0;max-width:100%;margin:20px 0 28px;overflow-x:auto;overscroll-behavior-inline:contain;box-sizing:border-box;\"><table style=\"width:100%;min-width:0;max-width:100%;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;box-sizing:border-box;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"min-width:150px;max-width:340px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">Field</th><th style=\"min-width:150px;max-width:340px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;background:#f2f4f7;color:#182230;text-align:left;font-weight:700;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"min-width:150px;max-width:520px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\"><code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;\">source_rank</code></td><td style=\"min-width:150px;max-width:520px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color:#475467;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal;box-sizing:border-box;\">Original position in the deduplicated Google Maps result feed before continuation and history exclusions.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"min-width:150px;max-width:520px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #d0d5dd;color: