 businesses where an independent website was not verified.</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Keep every checked business with an evidence-backed lead status.</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0;padding-left:4px;\">Capture public phone, email, contact page, website, and social routes when available.</li></ul><h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;max-width:100%;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Who Can Use It?</h2><p style=\"max-width:100%;margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;\">Web design agencies, local marketing teams, and lead generation specialists can use the records to prioritize public-business research and evidence-based outreach.</p><h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;max-width:100%;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">How Many Results Can You Check?</h2><p style=\"max-width:100%;margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;\">The published default checks up to <code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;\">5</code> businesses. You can increase <code style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f2f4f7;color:#344054;font-size:0.92em;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;\">max_results</code> within the Bot's supported range; every successfully checked business is returned as its own row.</p><h2 style=\"border-top:1px solid #e4e7ec;padding-top:32px;max-width:100%;margin:42px 0 16px;color:#101828;font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Automation and Export</h2><p style=\"max-width:100%;margin:0 0 16px;color:#475467;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;\">B